Output completion.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' && eval "$(csw hook bash)" && clear` Enter
Show

Type "csw us"
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 200ms
Tab
Sleep 2500ms
Type "fr"
Tab
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
